    "content": "## Transforming Your Look: Hair Colour Trends in Surat\n\nHair colouring has evolved beyond simple grey coverage. Today, modern women in Katargam, Varachha, and Adajan view hair colour as the ultimate expression of personal style—from sun-kissed caramel balayage and subtle hazelnut highlights to rich mocha globals that add dimension and shine.\n\nHowever, finding the right **hair colour near me in Surat** means finding a certified colorist who understands warm Indian skin undertones, uses ammonia-free protective formulas, and safeguards your strands against damage from Surat's high-TDS hard tap water.\n\n---\n\n## Balayage vs. Traditional Highlights vs. Global Hair Colour\n\nUnderstanding the technique is key to achieving your dream hair:\n\n| Technique | Application Style | Regrowth Maintenance | Best Suited For | Surat Longevity |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **French Balayage** | Freehand painted gradient; soft blend at roots | Very Low (no harsh demarcation lines as hair grows) | Modern, low-maintenance dimension on Indian hair | 6 to 9 Months |\n| **Foil Highlights** | Precision foil weaving from roots to ends | Moderate (roots show after 8–10 weeks) | High-contrast, bright, multi-tonal looks | 3 to 4 Months |\n| **Ammonia-Free Global** | Uniform single-tone coverage root to tip | Monthly root touch-up needed for greys | Complete color overhaul, grey coverage & high gloss | 4 to 6 Weeks |\n| **Root Touch-Up** | Targets 1 to 2 inches of natural root regrowth | Every 4 to 6 weeks | Flawless 100% grey coverage | Ongoing |\n\nAt **Shree Beauty Studio**, our senior colorists use L'Oréal INOA (100% ammonia-free, oil-delivery system) to ensure zero scalp burning and maximum hair moisture. Explore our haircuts and color options on our [Explore Salon Services](/services) page.\n\n---\n\n## 2026 Hair Colour Price Guide in Katargam, Surat\n\nHair colouring prices in Surat depend on hair length, density, and whether pre-lightening (bleaching) with bond protectors is required:\n\n| Service Category | Neighborhood Parlour Rate | Premium Vesu Chain | Shree Beauty Studio Katargam |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Ammonia-Free Root Touch-Up** | ₹600 – ₹900 | ₹1,500 – ₹2,500 | ₹799 |\n| **Global Color (Shoulder Length)** | ₹1,800 – ₹2,500 | ₹4,000 – ₹6,000 | ₹2,199 |\n| **Global Color (Waist Length)** | ₹2,800 – ₹4,000 | ₹6,500 – ₹9,500 | ₹3,499 |\n| **Classic Foil Highlights (Crown / T-Zone)** | ₹1,500 – ₹2,500 | ₹3,500 – ₹5,500 | ₹1,999 |\n| **Full Dimensional Balayage + Gloss Toner** | ₹3,500 – ₹5,500 | ₹8,000 – ₹14,000 | ₹4,499 – ₹5,999 |\n\nCheck all our salon pricing on our [Check Transparent Price List](/price-list).\n\n---\n\n## The Most Flattering Hair Shades for Indian Complexions\n\nOur master colorists specialize in selecting shades that complement warm olive and golden Indian undertones:\n\n- **Caramel & Warm Honey:** The most requested shade in Surat; brightens facial features without washing out golden skin tones.\n- **Chestnut Mocha & Dark Chocolate:** A subtle, luxurious choice that looks effortlessly polished under office lights.\n- **Burgundy & Plum Wine:** Perfect for women seeking a bold, rich pop of colour that glistens beautifully under sunlight.\n- **Cinnamon & Toffee:** Adds warmth and soft texture to dark brown and black hair.\n\nPlanning a complete pre-wedding glow-up? Explore our [View Bridal Packages](/bridal) for tailored bridal hair coloring.\n\n---\n\n## Protecting Hair Color in Surat's Weather & Hard Water\n\n1. **Color-Safe Sulfate-Free Shampoo:** Standard drugstore shampoos wash away expensive pigments within weeks. Use gentle, color-protecting formulas.\n2. **Filtered Water Rinses:** Surat tap water contains minerals that oxidize hair color, turning cool tones brassy. Rinse with filtered water when possible.\n3. **Weekly Color-Protect Hair Mask:** Replenishes lipids stripped during the lightening process.\n\n---\n\n## Visit Katargam's Trusted Ladies Salon\n\nLocated at **22, Radhika Society, Opp. Cancer Hospital, Katargam, Surat**, Shree Beauty Studio provides certified colorists, imported branded formulations, bond-protecting plex additives, and 100% ladies-only privacy.\n\nReady to refresh your style with gorgeous hair color? [Book an Appointment](/book) today for your personalized color consultation!",
